The decision file for the wide-tool ceiling fix: what was decided, why,
what was dropped (a higher value, a diameter-scaled cap, tiling, the
f32 twin in the same PR) and the cost to change it later.

Fixes #4079

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
